      "description": "Watch HNK Rijeka vs FC Midtjylland highlights and goals from UEFA Europa Conference League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 27, 2026. On August 27, 2026 , HNK Rijeka hosted FC Midtjylland in a highly anticipated UEFA Conference League clash. The stage was set for a classic European encounter as both sides looked to secure a vital result in front of a passionate crowd. Early Misfortune and Midtjylland Dominance The match began in nightmare fashion for the hosts. Just four minutes in, Martin Erlic inadvertently sent the ball into his own net, gifting FC Midtjylland an early lead. The visitors capitalized on the momentum, and in the 17th minute, Stanley Iheanacho doubled the advantage with a powerful header from close range following a pinpoint delivery from Kjell Waetjen . Rijeka’s evening went from bad to worse when Erlic , already troubled by the own goal, had to be substituted due to an injury in the 31st minute, making way for Adam Gabriel . Second-Half Surge The second half saw no respite for the Croatian side. In the 51st minute, Dario Osorio found the back of the net with a clinical left-footed strike, assisted by Denil Castillo . The onslaught continued just five minutes later when Magnus Jensen slotted home with his right foot after being played in by Rasmus Nissen . Midtjylland manager then turned to his bench, introducing fresh legs including Franculino and Gue-Sung Cho to maintain the high intensity. Clinical Finish to a European Night As the clock ticked down, the visitors showed no signs of slowing. In the 78th minute, Gue-Sung Cho climbed highest to head home a cross from Sofus Johannesen , putting the game completely out of reach. Despite a flurry of tactical changes from Rijeka and a late yellow card for Ante Majstorovic , the outcome was never in doubt. The referee blew the final whistle after four minutes of stoppage time, bringing an end to a dominant display by the Danish outfit."
